<p>Any time you block an attack with Buckler Expertise or Buckler Mastery you instantly counterattack with your sling for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 33%, 43%, 52%, 59%</acronym> damage  This can only occur up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> time(s) per turn.</p><p></p>